# Butler Routes - Feralas completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Feralas accept in the local census (57 quests, docs/feralas-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. The 41 Horde-accept
# quests stay with the Horde block's census; 6 above-band records, 2 seasonal
# elders and 1 broken record are out with reasons in the census.
# No race header: nothing contracted is race-locked, so per-line gates carry
# the rest (one Druid quest, the Leatherworking chain, the level-60 writs).
# Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept. Four accepts whose pres sit
# outside every pack contract ride dedicated `when onquest` mini-steps, each
# standing alone (3781 lives in the Darnassus guide; 2943, 3909 and 4142 are
# named pickups, not pack content). Five objectives have no placed source in
# the data (Stave, Sparkling Stone, Morrowgrain, Atal'ai Haze, the writ
# craft-ins) and take the Ironforge-2200 handling: accept, honest note,
# turnin, no invented complete. Item- and object-started quests never wedge
# (note at the source, sourcing optional). Coordinates use the era frame the
# data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/feralas
title Feralas - Completionist
levels 38-50
zone Feralas
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Feathermoon Stronghold - landfall

  zone map 1444

  tip The stronghold holds the chains: Shandris (30.28, 46.17) posts the Solarsal and Hatecrest work, Latronicus (30.38, 46.17) runs the coast and the courier line, Ginro (31.86, 45.13) holds the wreckage end, Troyas (31.78, 45.5) seeks knowledge, Angelas (31.83, 45.61) watches the ogres, Quintis (32.45, 43.79) studies grain, Shyria (30.97, 43.49) keeps the inn, Pratt (30.63, 42.71) buys hides, and the WANTED poster (31.09, 43.84) names Ohk'zi. Take every quest in town before you head out.
  accept 2866 only Alliance -- The Ruins of Solarsal - Shandris Feathermoon; the Solarsal Gazebo, west
  accept 4124 only Alliance -- The Missing Courier - Latronicus Moonspear; Ginro Hearthkindle takes the word
  turnin 4124 only Alliance -- The Missing Courier - the word to Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4125 only Alliance -- The Missing Courier - Ginro Hearthkindle; the Wrecked Row Boat, far south
  accept 2939 only Alliance -- In Search of Knowledge - Troyas Moonbreeze; Daryn Lightwind takes it in Teldrassil, late
  note 2879's pre (2943, Return to Troyas) accepts outside every pack guide - take 2939 now, pick up 2943 from Daryn when the Teldrassil leg turns 2939 in, and 2879 rides its own soft-pre step after.
  accept 2982 only Alliance -- The High Wilderness - Angelas Moonbreeze; Gordunni in the east
  accept 3445 only Alliance -- The Sunken Temple - Angelas Moonbreeze; Marvon Rivetseeker waits in Tanaris, late
  accept 2821 only Alliance -- The Mark of Quality - Pratt McGrubben; ten Thick Yeti Hides
  note 92858's poster hangs here - Ohk'zi works the east, and the staff comes off him.
  accept 92858 only Alliance -- WANTED: Ohk'zi - the WANTED poster; the Staff of Ohk'zi, east

