  tip Rockbiter (42.39, 22.00) holds the north camp; Shay (38.22, 10.30) waits south of him. Marli Wishrunner (45.82, 16.47) runs an errand east of the camp, and Gregan Brewspewer (45.12, 25.57) works south of her.
